Installation process

Dependencies:

git
make
golang
gtk3-devel
glib2-devel
cairo-devel
cairo-gobject-devel
pango-devel
libXcursor-devel
libpng-devel
golang-github-gotk3-devel
xcur2png

Install dependencies

sudo dnf install
git
make
golang
gtk3
gtk3-devel
glib2-devel
cairo-devel
cairo-gobject-devel
pango-devel
libXcursor-devel
libpng-devel
golang-github-gotk3-devel

Install xcur2png

cd ~/Downloads

git clone https://github.com/eworm-de/xcur2png.git

cd xcur2png

./configure
make
sudo make install

Verify:

which xcur2png
xcur2png --help

Ps:
On xcur2png config file, change:

extern dry_run;

For this:

extern int dry_run;

Then:

make clean
make
sudo make install

DOwnload nwg-look

cd ~/Downloads

git clone https://github.com/nwg-piotr/nwg-look.git

cd nwg-look

git checkout v1.1.1

Compile nwg-look

make build

Install

sudo make install

Testing

nwg-look

Also testing:

nwg-look -v
nwg-look -h

Verify executable:

which nwg-look

